{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Geode is a ",["l","矿物","Mineral"]," deposit that contains ",["l","矿物","minerals"],", ",["l","古物","artifacts"],", ores, or basic resources. It can be obtained from breaking rocks above ground in Stardew Valley and in ",["l","矿井","the Mines"]," (especially floors 1-39), or dropped by ",["l","掘地虫","Duggies"],". It may also be found in ",["l","钓鱼#Treasure Chests","Fishing Treasure Chests"],", in the ",["l","垃圾桶","Garbage Can"]," outside the ",["l","博物馆","Museum"]," or received as a gift at the ",["l","冬日星盛宴","Feast of the Winter Star"],". A ",["l","石鱼","Stonefish"]," ",["l","鱼塘","Fish Pond"]," may produce 1 or 5 Geodes when its population reaches 9. Geodes can also be obtained by pickaxing ",["l","采矿#Geode Node","Geode Nodes"],". 2-4 Geodes may occasionally be found in ",["l","补给箱","Supply Crate"],"s on the ",["l","农场地图#Beach","Beach Farm"]," if the player has not upgraded the ",["l","农舍","Farmhouse"]," yet. Geodes cannot be obtained from breaking rocks on Spring 1 of Year 1."]],["p",["The geode can be broken open by ",["l","克林特","Clint"]," in the ",["l","铁匠铺","Blacksmith shop"]," for 25g or by using a ",["l","晶球破开器","Geode Crusher"],"."]],["p",["Neither daily ",["l","运气","luck"]," nor luck ",["l","效果","buffs"]," affect the contents of a Geode."]]]],["Geode Contents",2,[]],["Artifacts",3,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Probability"]}],[[["f","Dwarvish_Helm.png",24]],[["l","矮人头盔","Dwarvish Helm"]],["1/32"]]]]]],["Foraged Minerals",3,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Probability"]}],[[["f","Earth_Crystal.png",24]],[["l","地晶","Earth Crystal"]],["1/16"]]]]]],["Geode Minerals",3,[["p",["All Geode Minerals have a 1/32 chance to appear."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]}],[[["f","Alamite.png",24]],[["l","透闪石","Alamite"]]],[[["f","Calcite.png",24]],[["l","方解石","Calcite"]]],[[["f","Celestine.png",24]],[["l","天青石","Celestine"]]],[[["f","Granite.png",24]],[["l","花岗岩","Granite"]]],[[["f","Jagoite.png",24]],[["l","铁铅矿","Jagoite"]]],[[["f","Jamborite.png",24]],[["l","绿水镍矿","Jamborite"]]],[[["f","Limestone.png",24]],[["l","石灰石","Limestone"]]],[[["f","Malachite.png",24]],[["l","孔雀石","Malachite"]]],[[["f","Mudstone.png",24]],[["l","泥石","Mudstone"]]],[[["f","Nekoite.png",24]],[["l","新硅钙石","Nekoite"]]],[[["f","Orpiment.png",24]],[["l","雌黄","Orpiment"]]],[[["f","Petrified_Slime.png",24]],[["l","石化史莱姆","Petrified Slime"]]],[[["f","Sandstone.png",24]],[["l","沙岩","Sandstone"]]],[[["f","Slate.png",24]],[["l","板岩","Slate"]]],[[["f","Thunder_Egg.png",24]],[["l","雷公蛋","Thunder Egg"]]]]]]],["Resources",3,[["p",["Note that obtaining Iron Ore from a Geode is only possible after reaching level 26 of ",["l","矿井","The Mines"],". Before reaching level 26, a geode that would give iron ore will instead give copper ore. Except for clay and stone, the following items will be obtained in the following amounts: 30% for 1, 30% for 3, 30% for 5, 9% for 10, and 1% for 20. Stone has a 50% chance to use those values and a 50% chance to give only 1. Only 1 clay can be obtained from a single geode."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Probability"]}],[[["f","Stone.png",24]],[["l","石头","Stone"]],["1/8"]],[[["f","Clay.png",24]],[["l","粘土","Clay"]],["1/16"]],[[["f","Coal.png",24]],[["l","煤炭","Coal"]],["1/12"]],[[["f","Copper_Ore.png",24]],[["l","铜矿石","Copper Ore"]],["1/12"]],[[["f","Iron_Ore.png",24]],[["l","铁矿石","Iron Ore"]],["1/12"]]]]]],["Gifting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Dislike"]},[["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],", ",["l","玛鲁","Maru"],", ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"],", ",["l","莱纳斯","Linus"],", ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"],", ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],", ",["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],", ",["l","乔治","George"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],", ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","潘妮","Penny"],", ",["l","潘姆","Pam"],", ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],", ",["l","海莉","Haley"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"],", ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"],", ",["l","肯特","Kent"],", ",["l","山姆","Sam"],", ",["l","莉亚","Leah"],", ",["l","谢恩","Shane"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","艾利欧特","Elliott"],", ",["l","格斯","Gus"],", ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"],", ",["l","法师","Wizard"],", ",["l","哈维","Harvey"],", ",["l","桑迪","Sandy"],", ",["l","威利","Willy"],", ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"],", ",["l","雷欧","Leo"]]]]]]],["Tailoring",2,[["p",["Geode is used in the spool of the ",["l","柳巷2号#Sewing Machine","Sewing Machine"]," to create the ",["l","裁缝","Gray Hoodie"],". ",["f","Shirt160.png",24]," It can be used in ",["l","染色","dyeing"],", serving as an orange dye at the dye pots, located in ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],"'s and ",["l","海莉","Haley"],"'s house, ",["l","柳巷2号","2 Willow Lane"],"."]]]],["Quests",2,[["l",0,[[1,["Two Geodes may be requested by ",["l","太阳鱼","Sunfish"]," in a ",["l","鱼塘#Quests","Fish Pond quest"]," to increase the capacity of the pond from 3 to 5."]],[1,["Five Geodes may be requested by ",["l","石鱼","Stonefish"]," in a ",["l","鱼塘#Quests","Fish Pond quest"]," to increase the capacity of the pond from 5 to 7."]],[1,["Eight Geodes may be requested by the Raccoon at the ",["l","大树桩（地点）","Giant Stump"]," as part of his fifth request, or as part of any request starting with the sixth."]]]]]],["History",2,[["l",0,[[1,[["l","版本历史#1.4","1.4"],": Can now be used in ",["l","裁缝","Tailoring"],". Can be requested in ",["l","鱼塘#Quests","Fish Pond quests"],". Can be produced by ",["l","鱼塘","Fish Pond"],"s."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.5","1.5"],": Can now be found in ",["l","补给箱","Supply Crate"],"s on the ",["l","农场地图#Beach","Beach Farm"],"."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.6","1.6"],": May now be requested by the Raccoon. No longer obtainable from mining ",["l","随机事件#Meteorite","meteorites"],"."]]]]]]]}